{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04946","headline":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制 · 薛稷","name":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九春风景足林泉，四面云霞敞御筵。\n花镂黄山绣作苑，草图玄灞锦爲川。\n飞觞竞醉心回日，走马争先眼着鞭。\n喜奉仙游归路远，直言行乐不言旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}